configuration for all the planned experiments, focusing on the ones still marked as pending while accounting for what's already been completed or is currently running. The Qwen-Math cross-model experiments are mostly complete, with the GRPO runs for both architectures at 25% still preparing. Now I need to write out the full prediction YAML, making sure each experiment has detailed predictions and rationales while staying consistent with the tier definitions.","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":19867,"cache_read_input_tokens":11841,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":19867},"output_tokens":9,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"ab5731f7-b47d-4dab-9a71-8ef9ffe1cf05","uuid":"7d31dd8b-6647-42a1-b8a1-273c0f08c018"}
